{{also|господь}}
==Russian==

===Noun===
'''Господь''' (χospód’) {{m}}
: ''Note: Some people prefer to capitalize this word:''''' Господь'''''. Also, some people, especially northerners, will pronounce the '''''Г''''' hard instead of as '''''Х'''. ''The [[vocative case]] is much more likely to be pronounced with a very soft '''''Х'''.

# the [[Lord]], [[God]]
#:* {{Cyrl|Го́споди!}} ''([[vocative case|vocative]])'' — ''Good Lord!''
#:* {{Cyrl|[[не|Не]] [[давать|дай]] Го́споди!}} — ''God forbid!''
#:* {{Cyrl|Госпо́дь [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!}} — ''God only knows!; Who knows?''
#:* {{Cyrl|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[ты|тобо́й]]!}} — ''Bless you!; ''also:'' Get outta here! (incredulity)''
#:* {{Cyrl|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[он|ним]]!}} — ''Forget him!''

